{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05914","headline":"冬夜书怀 · 王维","name":"冬夜书怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冬宵寒且永，夜漏宫中发。\n草白霭繁霜，木衰澄清月。\n丽服暎颓颜，朱灯照华髪。\n汉家方尚少，顾影慙朝谒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05914.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05914","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}